<Base title="About this example"><section class="wrap page-section"><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A first chapter</span><h1>About this example.</h1></header><div class="prose"><p>COMPRENDS PAS is a personal journal about a new life in Strasbourg. This example uses the introduction from the existing draft, adapted into a diary entry. The favourite-spot entry is demonstration content, not accounts of the author's experiences. Publication dates are illustrative.</p><p>The photos below are openly licensed stand-ins for your own photography. No personal Instagram account or video has been connected yet.</p><h2>Photographs</h2><ul><li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Strasbourg,_Petite_France.jpg">Strasbourg, Petite France</a> by Pierre Blaché — <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0</a>.</li><li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Strasbourg_cathedral_facade.jpg">Strasbourg Cathedral facade</a> by DrMoschi — <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Resized and displayed with cropping; the adapted image remains available under the same license.</li></ul><h2>The map</h2><p>Map data and tiles © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>. The default tiles are loaded from OpenStreetMap. If configured, the alternative Voyager tiles are supplied by <a href="https://carto.com/attribution/">CARTO</a>.</p></div></section></Base>

